Package: ros.form.validation
Title: Validate Regional Observer Scheme Submissions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Validates supplied Indian Ocean Tuna Commission Regional Observer
    Scheme data with versioned generated and business rules. Uses the
    form.validation engine and explicit reference snapshots, returning
    structured findings and execution status, with single-input CSV and HTML
    reports.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/ros.form.validation/,
